B) SEC certified true copy of its Certificate of Incorporation;

C) SEC certified true copy of its Amended Articles of Incorporation which includes the following provisions: AHTICD

1) That the corporation/association is non-stock, non-profit;

2) That no part of the net income shall inure to the benefit of any of its members;

3) That the trustees do not receive any compensation; and

4) That in case of dissolution, assets of the corporation/association shall be transferred to a similar institution or to the government.

